## Event: Login

  sequenceDiagram
      participant CheckLogin
      participant UserDAO
      participant index.html
      participant Session
      participant GoToHomeDocente
      participant GoToHomeStudente
  
      CheckLogin->>UserDAO: checkCredentials
      UserDAO->>CheckLogin: user | | null
      
      CheckLogin->>index.html: [user == null] redirect
      
      CheckLogin->>Session: [user != null] setAttribute("user", user)
   
      CheckLogin->>GoToHomeDocente: [user.role == "Docente"] redirect
      CheckLogin->>GoToHomeStudente: [user.role == "Studente"] redirect

## Role based access control

  sequenceDiagram
      participant ...
      participant GoToHomeDocente
      participant index.html
      participant Session
      participant HomeDocente.html
  
      ...->>GoToHomeDocente: GET /GoToHomeDocente
      GoToHomeDocente->>index.html: [session isNew || user == null] redirect
      GoToHomeDocente->>Session: getAttribute ("user")
      GoToHomeDocente->>index.html: [user.role != "docente"] redirect
      GoToHomeDocente->>HomeAdmin.html: [user.role == "docente"] redirect
      
          
